# Job Portal System

A full-stack Job Portal application built with **Spring Boot** (backend) and **Angular** (frontend), featuring JWT authentication, role-based access control, and a resume builder with PDF generation.

---

## Tech Stack

| Layer | Technology |
|---|---|
| Backend | Java 17, Spring Boot 3.2.5 |
| Security | Spring Security, JWT (JJWT), BCrypt |
| Database | MySQL 8 |
| Frontend | Angular 21 (SSR) |
| PDF | iTextPDF 5.5 |
| Docs | Swagger / OpenAPI 3 |

---

## Features

### Authentication & Security
- User registration with BCrypt password hashing
- JWT-based login with token expiry
- Role-based access: `USER`, `RECRUITER`, `ADMIN`
- Protected routes via Angular auth guard + HTTP interceptor
- Input validation on all API endpoints

### APIs
- `POST /api/v1/auth/register` — Register new user
- `POST /api/v1/auth/login` — Login and receive JWT
- `GET  /users/jobs/all` — Browse all job listings
- `POST /api/jobs/post` — Post a job (RECRUITER)
- `GET  /users/applications/user/{id}` — View my applications
- `POST /users/applications/apply` — Apply to a job
- `POST /resume/generate` — Generate PDF resume
- `GET  /api/admin/users` — All users (ADMIN only)
- `DELETE /api/admin/job/{id}` — Delete job (ADMIN only)

### Frontend (Angular)
- Register / Login pages with JWT storage
- User dashboard with job listings
- Application tracking
- Resume builder with live preview + PDF download
- Recruiter dashboard for posting and managing jobs
- Admin dashboard for user and job management

