## Security Practices

- Passwords hashed with BCrypt (strength 10) — never stored as plain text
- JWT tokens expire after 24 hours
- CORS configured to allow only `localhost:4200`
- Input validated with `@Valid` + `@NotBlank` / `@Email` annotations
- Global exception handler returns structured error responses (no stack traces exposed)
- SQL injection prevented via Spring Data JPA parameterized queries

